WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.722
Both methods are useful UNION ALL is explicit and
easy to read when

00:00:05.748 --> 00:00:11.649
there are only a few columns LATERAL VALUES is
compact when many columns

00:00:11.675 --> 00:00:17.204
follow the same repeated structure The correct
choice is the one that keeps the

00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:19.362
transformation clear and maintainable
